{"hw":"ἐφεξῆς","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐφεξῆς</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐφεξῆς</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπεξῆς</span>, poet. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐφεξείης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Orph.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">A.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">327</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">357</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in order, in a row, one after another</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἵζεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.18</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χωρεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1390</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἑστάναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ec.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">842</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἵστασθ' ἐ. πάντες</span> all <b class=\"lex-tr\">in a row</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">66</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. ἐπὶ κέρως τεταγμέναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eub.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">67.4</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Xenarch.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.6</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φάλαγγα βάθος ἐ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.5.23</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ ἐ. λεγόμενα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">261d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἵν' ἐ. ἡμῖν ὁ λόγος ἴῃ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">281d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰς πράξεις ἐ. διελθεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.26</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. ἀποκρίνεσθαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in a connected manner</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ruf.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Interrog.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2</span> </span>: c. Art., <span class=\"gk\">ᾖα τὰς ἐ. [πολιτείας] ἐρῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">449a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">696e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ ἐ. γωνία</span> the <b class=\"lex-tr\">adjacent</b> angle, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Euc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.14</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">αἱ ἐ. τομαί</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">adjacent</b> sections, of branches of a hyperbola and its conjugate, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Apollon.</span> </span> Perg.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Con.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.19</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">γραμμαὶ ἐ. κείμεναι</span> a <b class=\"lex-tr\">series</b> of straight lines, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Archim.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Spir.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10</span> </span>;